   "y": 692,
   "width": 580,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "{\"decision\": \"block\", \"reason\":\n \"⛔ codex-auto-startstop: the usage window\n  is at 82% (resets 02:37). Immediately:\n  (1) write HANDOFF.md — DONE / NEXT /\n  BLOCKED / RESUME; (2) 3-line summary;\n  (3) stop. Work resumes automatically.\"}",
