  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "p3_ann",
   "x": 1060,
   "y": 1030,
   "width": 810,
   "height": 36,
   "text": "The hook sleeps between windows — it reads one JSONL tail per turn end and costs no API budget.   trigger: 5h | weekly | both selects which limit drives the stop/resume.   Optional: use_reset_credits redeems a Codex usage-limit reset at the threshold (no handoff).",
   "originalText": "The hook sleeps between windows — it reads one JSONL tail per turn end and costs no API budget.   trigger: 5h | weekly | both selects which limit drives the stop/resume.   Optional: use_reset_credits redeems a Codex usage-limit reset at the threshold (no handoff).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
